---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Ethan Fang, Tennis Coach" description="Ethan Fang's tennis history — competitive junior player, private coach, and CWRU Club Tennis.">
  <article class="post container">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back</a>

    <header class="post__header">
      <h1 class="post__title">Ethan Fang, Tennis Coach</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="post__body">
      <p>
        I played competitive junior tennis from 2015 to 2021. I reached a peak Universal Tennis Rating (UTR) of 10,
        competed in numerous Super Nationals Level 1 tournaments, and represented Team Northern California in Zonals.
        In high school I finished 2nd in the state in individual doubles, playing alongside my best friend. Along the
        way I was sponsored by Adidas, Babolat, and Solinco.
      </p>
      <p>
        After that I spent 2021 and 2022 coaching privately, working with students who ranged from complete beginners
        to college players. I served as both a hitting partner and a coach, depending on what the student needed.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Case Western from 2022 to 2026, I helped grow club tennis from 20 members to 120 and secured a sponsorship
        with Celinka. Practices got popular enough that sign-ups would sell out in under 9 seconds, and we set record
        numbers for membership and tournament attendance every year I was there.
      </p>
      <p>
        I still coach occasionally. If you want to hit or need a coach, reach out.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .post {
    padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
    width: min(100% - 2.5rem, 720px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    background-image: none;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    transition: color 180ms ease;
  }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .post__header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .post__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .post__body {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .post__body p {
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0 0 1.1em;
  }
  .post__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

</style>
